{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_129_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_129_1086_027say", "source_sha256": "50e2fd797806e3540023d6f9ea63c78ea14da8091d217a81b1a68874e1220e78", "ja": "はい！　この前の番組も、\nもうすぐ放送されるんですよね？", "zh": "是！前段时间录制的节目，也快要播出了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
